¬}\pard \s41 \li1512 \fi0 \ri1007 \ql ignoreSpelling:\
\fs6\
\s39 \li2520 \fi-604 \f1 \b0 \fs28 \f3 -\f1 \'80(void)\b ignoreSpelling:\b0 (id)\i sender\i0  \
\fs14\
\fs28 \pard \s3 \li1512 \fi0 \ri1007 \ql \tx3603 \tx3981 \tx4359 Implement to allow an application to ignore misspelled words on a document-by-document basis. This message is sent by the NSSpellChecker instance to the object whose text is being checked.\
\fs14\
\fs28 Implement this method by using the code shown in the protocol description.\
\fs14\
